    "detailed_description": "<strong>WARNING: NO SINGLE PLAYER</strong><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fun party game you could play between football and mortal kombat.</h2>                                                                                           <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893320/extras/bd6384c0f0407bf45ff67f4f797e61ac.poster.avif?t=1646840927\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893320/extras/bd6384c0f0407bf45ff67f4f797e61ac.webm?t=1646840927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893320/extras/bd6384c0f0407bf45ff67f4f797e61ac.mp4?t=1646840927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></strong>Players control their clunky billiard balls with a cue stuck on it's top. The only goal is to kill other players.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Score balls to get buffs!<br></li><li>Enjoy clunky physics simulation<br></li><li>Several skins and playgrounds</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controls</h2>WASD/Left stick to move.<br><br>Space, A on XBOX, X on PS4 to shoot.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">E N J O Y</h2>",
